    "body": "## Is there a related GitHub Issue?\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n## What is this change about?\r\nThis PR adds a new ADR recording the decision to merge the `cf-k8s-api` and `cf-k8s-controllers` repositories together. The status of the ADR is `accepted` with the assumption that merging the PR equates to accepting the decision. If we decide not to move forward with this, we should just close the PR.\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\nYes\r\n\r\n## Acceptance Steps\r\nRead the ADR and raise any concerns in a review.\r\n\r\n## Tag your pair, your PM, and/or team\r\n@cloudfoundry/cf-k8s ",
